    { hero: Hero.EMRE, body: "{}{}{}{}{}{}{}{}".format(ChangelogCommon[0], Hero.EMRE, ChangelogCommon[3], "+35%", ChangelogCommon[5], "-10%", "\r\n{} 赛博手雷 额外造成50点伤害，使其燃烧{}秒\r\n{} 虹吸冲击枪 冷却时间降低至8秒\r\n  \r\n*覆盖协议：使命中的敌人燃烧 造成75+{}%最大生命值额外伤害".format(abilityIconString(Hero.EMRE, Button.ABILITY_2), EmreBuff[0], abilityIconString(Hero.EMRE, Button.ABILITY_1), EmreBuff[1]), ChangelogCommon[1]) }, \
