    { hero: Hero.VENDETTA, body: "{}{}{}{}{}{}{}".format(ChangelogCommon[0], Hero.VENDETTA, ChangelogCommon[3], "+35%", "\r\n*受到伤害-45%", "\r\n{} 暴击额外其{}%最大生命值伤害，并回复{}最大生命值\r\n{} 每命中一名敌人回复{}%已损失生命值\r\n{} 使敌人沉默，持续期间不可阻挡\r\n{} 击倒敌人，生命值低于{}%的敌人将被斩杀".format(abilityIconString(Hero.VENDETTA, Button.PRIMARY_FIRE), VendettaBuff[0] * 100, VendettaBuff[6] * 100, abilityIconString(Hero.VENDETTA, Button.ABILITY_1), VendettaBuff[2] * 100, abilityIconString(Hero.VENDETTA, Button.ABILITY_2), abilityIconString(Hero.VENDETTA, Button.ULTIMATE), VendettaBuff[5] * 100), ChangelogCommon[1]) }, \
    { hero: Hero.VENTURE, body: "{}{}{}{}{}{}{}{}".format(ChangelogCommon[0], Hero.VENTURE, ChangelogCommon[3], "+40%", ChangelogCommon[5], "-30%", "\r\n钻地  \r\n  持续时间 +300%\r\n  移动速度 +156%\r\n钻头突刺 冷却时间 -25%", ChangelogCommon[1]) }, \
    { hero: Hero.WIDOWMAKER, body: "{}{}{}{}{}{}{}{}".format(ChangelogCommon[0], Hero.WIDOWMAKER, ChangelogCommon[3], "+35%", ChangelogCommon[5], "+15%", "\r\n*移除开镜伤害衰减", ChangelogCommon[1]) }, \
    { hero: Hero.WINSTON, body: "{}{}{}{}{}{}{}{}".format(ChangelogCommon[0], Hero.WINSTON, ChangelogCommon[5], "-35%", ChangelogCommon[3], "+10%", "\r\n{} 特斯拉炮-集束电击\r\n  回复已造成伤害的生命值并额外造成目标最大生命值{}%伤害\r\n{} 屏障发射器\r\n  冷却时间降低至12秒".format(abilityIconString(Hero.WINSTON, Button.SECONDARY_FIRE), WinstonBuff[0], abilityIconString(Hero.WINSTON, Button.ABILITY_2)), ChangelogCommon[1]) }, \
    { hero: Hero.WRECKING_BALL, body: "{}{}{}{}{}{}{}{}".format(ChangelogCommon[0], Hero.WRECKING_BALL, ChangelogCommon[3], "+35%", ChangelogCommon[5], "-15%", "\r\n*工程抓钩\r\n  冷却时间降低至4秒\r\n  在重生室中无冷却时间\r\n*感应护盾 冷却时间降低至12秒\r\n*重力坠击 冷却时间降低至6秒", ChangelogCommon[1]) }, \
    { hero: Hero.WUYANG, body: "{}{}{}{}".format(ChangelogCommon[0], Hero.WUYANG, "\r\n*水珠爆炸附带目标最大生命值8%额外伤害\r\n 并使{}CD-1秒\r\n{} 飞流步 回复{}生命值 减伤{}%\r\n{} 翻江浪 对同一目标命中2次后冻结{}秒\r\n{} 惊涛破 使友方回复满生命值".format(abilityIconString(Hero.WUYANG, Button.ABILITY_2), abilityIconString(Hero.WUYANG, Button.ABILITY_1), 4.5 * WuyangBuff[2], WuyangBuff[3], abilityIconString(Hero.WUYANG, Button.ABILITY_2), WUYANG_ABILITY2_FROZEN_DURATION, abilityIconString(Hero.WUYANG, Button.ULTIMATE)), ChangelogCommon[1]) }, \
    { hero: Hero.ZARYA, body: "{}{}{}{}{}{}{}{}".format(ChangelogCommon[0], Hero.ZARYA, ChangelogCommon[3], "+35%", ChangelogCommon[5], "-25%", "\r\n*胜利意志\r\n  生命值低于30%时触发\r\n  获得1秒无敌并重置屏障冷却\r\n  回复{}生命值\r\n{} 粒子屏障\r\n  冷却时间降低至9秒\r\n{} 投射屏障\r\n  为目标提供3秒50点临时生命值\r\n*重力喷涌\r\n  充能速度提高8%".format(ZaryaBuff[1] * ZaryaBuff[2], abilityIconString(Hero.ZARYA, Button.ABILITY_1), abilityIconString(Hero.ZARYA, Button.ABILITY_2)), ChangelogCommon[1]) }, \
    { hero: Hero.ZENYATTA, body: "{}{}{}{}{}{}".format(ChangelogCommon[0], Hero.ZENYATTA, ChangelogCommon[3], "+60%", "\r\n*弹道速度 +25%\r\n*暴击倍率提高至 ×{}\r\n*蹬 将敌人击退并让禅雅塔向反方向弹开\r\n*圣 治疗量提高至400/s 移速+25%\r\n  无法被命中 免疫所有控制".format(1 + HeadshotDamage[0]), ChangelogCommon[1]) }, \
]

rule "Initialize changelog body table":
    ChangelogCommon = ["\r\n●", "\n\n※※离开重生室隐藏", "\n\n※离开重生室隐藏", "\r\n*造成伤害 ", "\r\n*造成治疗 ", "\r\n*受到伤害 "]
    splitDictArray({
        hero: ChangelogHeroes,
        body: ChangelogBodyTable
    }, changelog_database)
